  "lyrics": "[Final Chorus – Tyler + Kizuna]\n[03:19.38]Forged above gold\n[03:22.00]We came through the flame\n[03:25.44]Not untouched\n[03:26.60]not unchanged\n[03:27.78]not ashamed\n[03:29.34]Forged above gold\n[03:31.44]Más fuerte que ayer\n[03:33.52]No more begging for the burn\n[03:36.04]just to know somebody's there\n[03:38.30]I can stand in the quiet\n[03:40.72]Yo me puedo quedar\n[03:42.44]I can carry my own light\n[03:45.44]Sin tenerte que salvar\n[Both]\n[03:47.90]Let the old fire go\n[03:50.92]There is nothing left to prove\n[03:54.48]We weren't made to burn forever\n[03:59.20]We were forged—\n[Break – Everything Cuts]\n[04:04.36]The fire didn't make me gold.\n[04:09.00]It taught me\n[04:11.66]I was worth more.\n[04:16.92]Más que oro.\n[04:18.78]Forged above gold.",
